      "text": "devil flatters men that there is no hell, 2 Ne. 28:22. Sherem uses much flattery, Jacob 7:4. people deceived by flattering and vain words of Noah3 and priests, Mosiah 11:7. unbelievers deceive many with flattering words, Mosiah 26:6. Alma2 did speak flattery to lead people into iniquity, Mosiah 27:8. Ammon2 flattered fellow-servants by his words, Alma 17:31. better that Korihor’s soul be lost than that he bring down many to destruction by flattering words, Alma 30:47. many in Church believe flattering words of Amalickiah, Alma 46:7. those who seek judgment-seat use much flattery to lead away hearts, Alma 61:4. Jacob4 flattered dissenters that many would join his band, 3 Ne. 7:12.",
